WEBVTT

00:00:00.549 --> 00:00:01.230
Hello!

00:00:01.247 --> 00:00:03.630
Customers can only book while your salon is open.

00:00:03.764 --> 00:00:06.672
So setting your opening hours correctly comes first,

00:00:06.622 --> 00:00:08.430
before you take bookings online.

00:00:08.592 --> 00:00:09.630
It only takes a minute.

00:00:10.261 --> 00:00:12.127
Tap Opening hours in the menu.

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:15.936
Under Weekly schedule, the fastest way is a quick preset,

00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:18.767
for example Monday to Saturday, nine to seven.

00:00:19.116 --> 00:00:20.767
Every day is filled in at once.

00:00:21.293 --> 00:00:25.352
To adjust a single day, use the switch to turn that day on or off,

00:00:25.302 --> 00:00:27.903
then change the opening and closing times.

00:00:28.251 --> 00:00:32.623
If you close for lunch, tap Add shift, to get a second shift that day.

00:00:32.842 --> 00:00:35.423
When you're done, tap Save opening hours.

00:00:36.084 --> 00:00:38.882
Further down is Holidays and closed days.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:44.319
Choose From, and To if you are closed for several days, write the reason,

00:00:44.269 --> 00:00:46.002
and tap Add closed days.

00:00:46.352 --> 00:00:49.122
Below are suggestions for upcoming public holidays:

00:00:49.159 --> 00:00:50.402
one tap adds them.

00:00:50.739 --> 00:00:52.882
On these days, customers can't book.

00:00:53.151 --> 00:00:54.482
Now take the quiz below.
